       <t indent="0" pn="section-2-1">In order to allow a PE to initiate the signaling exchange for a
 pseudowire without knowing the pseudowire type, a new PW Type is
 defined.  The codepoint is 0x7FFF.  The semantics are the following:</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-2">1.  To the targeted PE, this value indicates that it is to determine
-    the PW Type (for both directions) and signal that in a Label
